1922 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am a product designer \050UX\057UI\051 with 8 years of experience working on digital products\054 platforms\054 and web applications\056 My focus is on designing clear\054 scalable user experiences that support real product goals and work well in complex systems\056\n\nThroughout my career\054 I have worked closely with development teams\054 contributing not only to interface design but also to product structure\054 user flows\054 and design systems\056 Because of my technical background\054 I approach design with a strong understanding of how things are built\054 which helps me create solutions that are both user\055friendly and realistic to implement\056\n\nI am particularly interested in technical and platform products where design plays an important role in simplifying complex processes\056 \n\nMy strengths are structured thinking\054 problem\055solving\054 and the ability to turn complex ideas into simple and intuitive user experiences\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1923 0 R
     /Pg 1916 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
