1966 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Outside of work\054 I love being in nature and staying active\056 I enjoy cyclotouring\054 running\054 swimming\054 and calisthenics\056 Over the past three years\054 my biggest passions have been surfing and Brazilian jiu\055jitsu\056 These sports have taught me a lot about patience\054 problem\055solving\054 and staying calm when things get complicated\056 That same mindset strongly reflects how I approach work and life in general\056\nAs much as I enjoy discipline and routine\054 I also appreciate a bit of hedonism\054 cooking or sharing a nice meal\054 having a good cup of coffee with a friend\054 or going out dancing\056 )
     /K [ 25 ]
     /P 1967 0 R
     /Pg 1916 0 R
