2022 0 obj
  << /ActualText (SB22 is a fully immersive betting and transactional platform built from the ground up without relying on legacy technology\056 I was responsible for designing the product\031s UI and UX from the early stages and helping establish a clear and scalable design foundation\056\nI worked on the platform structure\054 user flows\054 visual identity\054 and design system\054 ensuring consistency across a wide range of screens and product features\056 A strong focus of my work was creating a responsive and adaptable interface that functions across multiple devices\054 including mobile\054 desktop\054 kiosks\054 smartwatches\054 Apple TV\054 and Apple Vision\056\nI collaborated daily with development teams to translate design into production\055ready solutions\054 using Figma for wireframing\054 prototyping\054 and high\055fidelity design\056 My role also included ensuring that the design system could scale with the product as new features and modules were added\056)
     /K [ 53 ]
     /P 2023 0 R
